WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.044
- All right y'all.

00:00:01.044 --> 00:00:02.430
It's almost time to say goodbye.

00:00:02.430 --> 00:00:04.890
But before we go I have
one more story of goodness

00:00:04.890 --> 00:00:06.130
I hope you'll enjoy.

00:00:06.130 --> 00:00:07.449
This is what I'm liking.

00:00:07.449 --> 00:00:08.489
(upbeat music)

00:00:08.489 --> 00:00:10.350
(crowd cheering)

00:00:10.350 --> 00:00:13.530
So last week I received the
sweetest mother's day gift

00:00:13.530 --> 00:00:15.550
from my friend Dule Hill.

00:00:15.550 --> 00:00:17.000
Take a look.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:18.094
- What's that?

00:00:18.094 --> 00:00:18.927
- Well, I have to tell you.

00:00:18.927 --> 00:00:19.760
- Okay.

00:00:19.760 --> 00:00:20.750
- Well, I come bearing a gift.

00:00:20.750 --> 00:00:21.583
- You're my favorite guest.

00:00:21.583 --> 00:00:22.677
- Yes.

00:00:22.677 --> 00:00:23.510
- Yeah. (Kelly laughing)

00:00:23.510 --> 00:00:24.343
- Here's the thing.

00:00:24.343 --> 00:00:25.900
My wife, Jazmyn Simon
wrote a children's book.

00:00:25.900 --> 00:00:26.770
- Oh yeah.

00:00:26.770 --> 00:00:28.508
- Called The Most Perfect You.

00:00:28.508 --> 00:00:29.341
- [Kelly} Okay.

00:00:29.341 --> 00:00:31.440
- And it's an ode to
motherhood and self love.

00:00:31.440 --> 00:00:33.120
And it's a reminder to anyone who's ever

00:00:33.120 --> 00:00:34.860
compared themself to anyone,

00:00:34.860 --> 00:00:37.383
that they're perfect exactly
the way that they are.

00:00:38.749 --> 00:00:41.509
- I hope the book in there for my kids.

00:00:41.509 --> 00:00:43.410
- You see in honor of rad mom's week.

00:00:43.410 --> 00:00:45.277
One rad mom, my wife, Jazmyn Simon.

00:00:45.277 --> 00:00:48.110
Wanted to present to you, another rad mom.

00:00:48.110 --> 00:00:50.170
This token of love to remind you

00:00:50.170 --> 00:00:53.217
that you are and always will
be the most perfect you.

00:00:53.217 --> 00:00:54.370
- I love this.

00:00:55.297 --> 00:00:56.820
(crowd applauding)

00:00:56.820 --> 00:00:58.890
No surprise, his wife
is an amazing writer.

00:00:58.890 --> 00:01:00.550
I took the book home and my kids loved it.

00:01:00.550 --> 00:01:02.770
We literally read every night.

00:01:02.770 --> 00:01:04.270
And it's like exciting for them now.

00:01:04.270 --> 00:01:06.920
It was like forced family fun at first.

00:01:06.920 --> 00:01:08.760
But I wanted to bring her
on cuz we love the book.

00:01:08.760 --> 00:01:10.750
So everybody say hi to actress and author,

00:01:10.750 --> 00:01:12.727
Jazmyn Simon.

00:01:12.727 --> 00:01:13.970
(crowd cheering)

00:01:13.970 --> 00:01:14.803
- [Kelly] Hi.

00:01:14.803 --> 00:01:15.890
Oh, you look stunning.

00:01:15.890 --> 00:01:17.496
Oh my gosh.

00:01:17.496 --> 00:01:18.750
Well I have to say first
you look beautiful.

00:01:18.750 --> 00:01:20.488
Secondly, I love the message of the book.

00:01:20.488 --> 00:01:21.321
- [Jazmyn] Thank you.

00:01:21.321 --> 00:01:22.410
- It's so important for kids,

00:01:22.410 --> 00:01:24.550
so tell me what inspired you to do it?

00:01:24.550 --> 00:01:27.100
- Well, we have a 17 year
old daughter named Kennedy,

00:01:27.100 --> 00:01:28.420
who's a senior in high school

00:01:28.420 --> 00:01:31.760
and a three and newly three
year old son named Levi.

00:01:31.760 --> 00:01:34.510
And when our daughter
Kennedy was three years old,

00:01:34.510 --> 00:01:35.990
we were riding in the car.

00:01:35.990 --> 00:01:37.687
And from the back seat she says to me,

00:01:37.687 --> 00:01:39.537
"Mommy, I wanna be pretty."

00:01:39.537 --> 00:01:42.240
"I need my skin to be white."

00:01:42.240 --> 00:01:45.040
And I said, "oh my God."

00:01:45.040 --> 00:01:47.740
And then, "Well Kennedy,
when you were in my belly

00:01:47.740 --> 00:01:49.410
I actually had a conversation with God.

00:01:49.410 --> 00:01:50.420
And I told him

00:01:50.420 --> 00:01:53.160
that I wanted you to have
my favorite color of skin.

00:01:53.160 --> 00:01:54.780
And that's why you're brown.

00:01:54.780 --> 00:01:56.960
And actually every single thing about you

00:01:56.960 --> 00:01:58.280
I got to pick myself.

00:01:58.280 --> 00:01:59.490
You have my favorite eyes,

00:01:59.490 --> 00:02:00.400
my favorite nose,

00:02:00.400 --> 00:02:01.400
my favorite hair.

00:02:01.400 --> 00:02:03.760
You are all of my favorite things."

00:02:03.760 --> 00:02:05.160
And she thought about it.

00:02:05.160 --> 00:02:07.410
And she said, "okay."

00:02:07.410 --> 00:02:10.200
And she moved on from the conversation.

00:02:10.200 --> 00:02:13.100
And in 2020, I looked out,

00:02:13.100 --> 00:02:14.730
we were going through a global pandemic.

00:02:14.730 --> 00:02:17.950
We had saw George Floyd
get murdered on TV.

00:02:17.950 --> 00:02:19.030
And I thought, oh my God

00:02:19.030 --> 00:02:21.050
what this world needs right now is love.

00:02:21.050 --> 00:02:22.990
And I want our children to know

00:02:22.990 --> 00:02:25.108
that they are perfect just
the way that they are.

00:02:25.108 --> 00:02:28.220
And so I wrote a book
called Most Perfect You,

00:02:28.220 --> 00:02:29.750
to remind children

00:02:29.750 --> 00:02:32.020
and the people that read to their children

00:02:32.020 --> 00:02:33.890
that they are absolutely perfect.

00:02:33.890 --> 00:02:36.030
Not in comparison to somebody else,

00:02:36.030 --> 00:02:38.530
but exactly the way that they are.

00:02:38.530 --> 00:02:39.767
- I love it.

00:02:39.767 --> 00:02:40.600
(audience applauding)

00:02:40.600 --> 00:02:42.140
It's just powerful all around.

00:02:42.140 --> 00:02:43.840
Thank you so much for sharing.

00:02:43.840 --> 00:02:45.410
Thank you so much, Jazmyn,
for the book as well.

00:02:45.410 --> 00:02:46.970
Cuz we read a lot at our house

00:02:46.970 --> 00:02:48.430
so it's nice to have a new book.

00:02:48.430 --> 00:02:50.770
I'm liking your post right now, right?

00:02:50.770 --> 00:02:53.310
- [Jazmyn] Thank you.

00:02:53.310 --> 00:02:54.143
- All right.

00:02:54.143 --> 00:02:56.640
So Most Perfect You by Jazmyn Simon.

00:02:56.640 --> 00:03:00.270
Illustrations by Tamisha
Anthony, which are beautiful.

00:03:00.270 --> 00:03:03.160
It's now available wherever
you get your books.

00:03:03.160 --> 00:03:04.850
Usually at this point in the show

00:03:04.850 --> 00:03:07.230
we'd give our guest a
thousand dollars courtesy

00:03:07.230 --> 00:03:08.860
of our season long partner, Pilot Pen,

00:03:08.860 --> 00:03:10.610
makers of Friction, the go-to erasable pen

00:03:10.610 --> 00:03:11.830
of the Kelly Clarkson show.

00:03:11.830 --> 00:03:13.770
But today, since you know,

00:03:13.770 --> 00:03:15.660
she got money, she fine.

00:03:15.660 --> 00:03:18.230
That money's going to
someone in the audience.

00:03:18.230 --> 00:03:20.240
And so look under your chairs.

00:03:20.240 --> 00:03:22.066
Somebody has it right now.

00:03:22.066 --> 00:03:23.470
(drum roll)

00:03:23.470 --> 00:03:26.346
Somebody has a thousand
dollars under their chair.

00:03:26.346 --> 00:03:28.866
(drum roll)

00:03:28.866 --> 00:03:29.796
(audience cheering)

00:03:29.796 --> 00:03:32.195
- [Kelly] Okay.

00:03:32.195 --> 00:03:37.195
Okay, okay.

00:03:38.610 --> 00:03:40.710
First of all, I love that you're in jeans.

00:03:40.710 --> 00:03:41.790
Like all these women in dresses,

00:03:41.790 --> 00:03:43.130
trying to be like polite about it.

00:03:43.130 --> 00:03:45.250
You can just like squat up under there

00:03:45.250 --> 00:03:46.340
and you took your time.

00:03:46.340 --> 00:03:47.173
What's your name?

00:03:47.173 --> 00:03:48.010
Where are you from?

00:03:48.010 --> 00:03:48.980
- My name is Kimina.

00:03:48.980 --> 00:03:50.200
I'm from Argentina.

00:03:50.200 --> 00:03:51.050
- [Kelly] Oh my God.

00:03:51.050 --> 00:03:52.476
Beautiful accent.

00:03:52.476 --> 00:03:53.744
(audience applauding)

00:03:53.744 --> 00:03:55.560
I just want to hear you talk more.

00:03:55.560 --> 00:03:58.330
I went to this states like two months ago.

00:03:58.330 --> 00:03:59.620
Oh my God.

00:03:59.620 --> 00:04:01.240
Well here's a thousand dollars.

00:04:01.240 --> 00:04:02.073
Have fun.

00:04:02.073 --> 00:04:03.680
Yeah. So fun.

00:04:03.680 --> 00:04:04.513
- Thank you.

